msgid "Follow the money. Find the evidence. Take action. An evidence-first civic platform for public projects, budgets, and citizen observations."
msgstr "Fuata pesa. Pata ushahidi. Chukua hatua. Jukwaa la kiraia linalotegemea ushahidi kwa miradi ya umma, bajeti, na maoni ya wananchi."

msgid "Investigate a project"
msgstr "Chunguza mradi"

msgid "Follow"
msgstr "Fuata"

msgid "Learn"
msgstr "Jifunze"

msgid "Account"
msgstr "Akaunti"

msgid "Terms of use"
msgstr "Masharti ya matumizi"

